{"article_id": "9769513", "title": "台積電ADR勁揚2.4%、日月光聯電更猛 台指期夜盤大漲728點", "date": "2026-09-22 07:38", "source": "經濟日報", "author": "葉亭均", "section": "綜合外電", "cover_image": {"src": "https://pgw.udn.com.tw/gw/photo.php?u=https://uc.udn.com.tw/photo/t3/2026/09/18/35339522.jpg&M=1&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=1280&sh=853&sl=W&fw=930&exp=3600&w=930", "alt": "台積電ADR收盤大漲3%。路透", "caption": "台積電ADR收盤大漲3%。路透"}, "body": [{"type": "text", "content": "台股ADR周一（22日）勁揚，在美國AI股熱絡行情下，台積電ADR收盤大漲逾2%，報每股445.14美元，收盤最新價格換算並折合新台幣後為每股2,826.82元，較台北交易股票溢價率為13.98%。"}, {"type": "text", "content": "日月光飆漲5%，聯電漲幅也超過3%。"}, {"type": "text", "content": "台指期夜盤大漲728點或1.51%，收在48,781點。"}, {"type": "text", "content": "美股四大指數收紅，道瓊工業指數21日收盤上漲366.19點，漲幅0.71%，報52,048.83點；標普500指數上漲114.20點，漲幅1.49%，收報7,764.70點，逼近歷史新高；那斯達克指數躍升599.55點，漲幅2.26%，報27,122.09點，創收盤新高。"}, {"type": "text", "content": "費城半導體指數大漲511.48點，漲幅4.29%，報12,433.171點。"}, {"type": "text", "content": "個股"}, {"type": "text", "content": "ADR代碼"}, {"type": "text", "content": "ADR收盤（換算後）"}, {"type": "text", "content": "漲跌幅(%)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "台北上市股票收盤價"}, {"type": "text", "content": "溢價率(%)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "日月光"}, {"type": "text", "content": "ASX"}, {"type": "text", "content": "694.26"}, {"type": "text", "content": "+5.04"}, {"type": "text", "content": "663.00"}, {"type": "text", "content": "+4.71"}, {"type": "text", "content": "中華電"}, {"type": "text", "content": "CHT"}, {"type": "text", "content": "145.74"}, {"type": "text", "content": "0.00"}, {"type": "text", "content": "144.50"}, {"type": "text", "content": "+0.86"}, {"type": "text", "content": "台積電"}, {"type": "text", "content": "TSM"}, {"type": "text", "content": "2,826.82"}, {"type": "text", "content": "+2.41"}, {"type": "text", "content": "2,480.00"}, {"type": "text", "content": "+13.98"}, {"type": "text", "content": "聯電"}, {"type": "text", "content": "UMC"}, {"type": "text", "content": "161.49"}, {"type": "text", "content": "+3.33"}, {"type": "text", "content": "157.00"}, {"type": "text", "content": "+2.86"}, {"type": "text", "content": "*匯率換算依據紐約時間下午5:30的彭博數據"}]}